      "cluster_id": 0,
      "headline_hint": "Trump renames AI 'super intelligence' and signs safety accord with tech leaders",
      "section": "world",
      "batch_position": 0,
      "claim_count": 20,
      "distinct_outlets": 5,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 20
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US President Donald Trump and top technology executives signed an accord to self-police artificial intelligence during a White House meeting on Tuesday.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/29/trump-top-tech-firms-sign-accord-to-self-police-ai-development?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Executives attending the White House meeting included OpenAI's Greg Brockman, Anthropic's Dario Amodei, Meta's Mark Zuckerberg, Google's Sundar Pichai, and Nvidia's Jensen Huang.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/29/trump-top-tech-firms-sign-accord-to-self-police-ai-development?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The accord stipulates that companies will implement internal controls, partner with an independent external auditor, and set up a board committee to evaluate audit reports.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/29/trump-top-tech-firms-sign-accord-to-self-police-ai-development?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Donald Trump described the AI accord to reporters as 'almost like a constitution' and a form of protection.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/29/trump-top-tech-firms-sign-accord-to-self-police-ai-development?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Donald Trump announced he is considering establishing a 10-person board to monitor AI tool safety and plans to appoint a White House official to lead AI policy.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/29/trump-top-tech-firms-sign-accord-to-self-police-ai-development?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "A Reuters/Ipsos poll conducted from September 17 to 20 found that 73 percent of respondents worry AI companies have not done enough to prevent harm.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/29/trump-top-tech-firms-sign-accord-to-self-police-ai-development?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "OpenAI's Greg Brockman and his wife Anna Brockman donated a combined $25 million to the pro-Trump MAGA Inc PAC in 2025.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/29/trump-top-tech-firms-sign-accord-to-self-police-ai-development?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Trump administration aides launched a new government service AI tool designed by Airbnb cofounder Joe Gebbia and sponsored by Google, SpaceX, Meta, and 8VC.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/29/trump-top-tech-firms-sign-accord-to-self-police-ai-development?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "President Donald Trump signed an executive order titled 'Inaugurating the Era of Super Intelligence' directing the federal government to replace the term 'Artificial Intelligence' with 'super intelligence'.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bigger-than-the-internet-trump-officially-renames-ai-as-super-intelligence/articleshow/134576549.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The executive order requires federal agencies to use 'Super Intelligence' and 'SI' in official settings going forward, but does not alter existing regulations or historical records retroactively.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bigger-than-the-internet-trump-officially-renames-ai-as-super-intelligence/articleshow/134576549.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The executive order set a 60-day deadline for the Assistant to the President for Science and Technology to submit proposed legislation to Congress for a statutory definition of super intelligence.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bigger-than-the-internet-trump-officially-renames-ai-as-super-intelligence/articleshow/134576549.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "SpaceX and Tesla chief Elon Musk attended the high-level White House luncheon with Donald Trump and other tech CEOs.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bigger-than-the-internet-trump-officially-renames-ai-as-super-intelligence/articleshow/134576549.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Director of National Intelligence Jay Clayton stated that being an AI leader in America is the most important thing for national security.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bigger-than-the-internet-trump-officially-renames-ai-as-super-intelligence/articleshow/134576549.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "House Speaker Mike Johnson joined Donald Trump at the White House meeting with tech leaders.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/technology/20260929-trump-says-ai-companies-sign-voluntary-accord-on-safety-controls",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei stated that AI technology has very real risks and the mechanisms to address them remain under discussion.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/technology/20260929-trump-says-ai-companies-sign-voluntary-accord-on-safety-controls",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Donald Trump promised that the US government would not limit the development of artificial intelligence or support restrictions.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/technology/20260929-trump-says-ai-companies-sign-voluntary-accord-on-safety-controls",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The White House accord outlines four layers of voluntary controls for AI companies covering external auditing, independent board oversight, internal monitoring of security threats, and dedicated internal safety teams.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/business/trump-releases-ai-accord-tech-executives-6419886",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "President Donald Trump ruled out any joint venture with China in artificial intelligence, saying it would be tantamount to giving away secrets.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwly5lmvy38qo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The US and Beijing launched a new AI dialogue and established a communication channel following Chinese President Xi Jinping's White House visit.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwly5lmvy38qo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "A late September Politico poll showed two out of every three Americans believe there is at least a moderate risk that AI could destroy humanity.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwly5lmvy38qo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
